think Each candidate is already a booked OPEN red in construction/REDS.md. instrument_suite is REDS %838 (20261010.095529), the fascia floor e113 leg reading 36 against 41, and the earlier row 20261001.234320 holds the same measurement. sunn14 is %837 (20261010.091510): the SOURCE.md thickness leg reds, and SUNN owns that text. remember_pin_history is the 20261002.005820 row: it asserts three artifacts that were removed by deliberate, dated acts, and %839 names a missing counter and backup ref.
think Run GREEN-first, as the ABSENCE clause asks. sunn14 stops at line 70 on thickness RED. remember_pin_history stops at its habit count assert. instrument_suite is not run here; its card note already states the fascia floor red.
think Rostering a red would turn the cold run red for a fault no lap here may repair. The honest move is to hold the fruit and say so, not to patch the witnesses or weaken their assertions.
think Claim board read before any claim: fleet_claim_scan --check on the two live candidates returned verdict=clear, claims_live=0, board=upstream. Nothing was claimed because nothing is being built.
